k into a set of drums! Use your kitchen table to set up an epic car stunt jump, equipped with fireworks and all! If you can imagine it, then build it!\n", "short_description": "Push the boundaries of your imagination. Blur the boundaries between realities. In Gizmo Builder, you can make a vast number of different machines from over 80 components. Use the latest advancements in mixed reality to use objects and surfaces in the real world as part of your creations"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freerangegames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.freerangegames.com/terms-conditions", "publisher_name": "Free Range Gamse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.freerangegames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1046595239294231"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 13, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1042961784525713"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "945794453848169"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "1010705570105934"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "351466597334059"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "6835569286455966"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "1772969859893287"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "5290067511029648"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "547189433973801"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "941784707